      "en": "and he lived eastward even to the entrance of the wilderness from the river Euphrates, because their livestock were multiplied in the land of Gilead.",
      "ko": "또 동으로 가서 거하여 유브라데강에서부터 광야 지경까지 미쳤으니 이는 길르앗 땅에서 그 생축이 번식함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "c7655e2c4e4ff88f71b248c620696559ee974f29a570a4d0402093419daf7478",
      "translation_text_hash": "65923a572792e686b776f875ec63aef89bf2b75c2fbc6ce0ea77a8178e43e3d8",
