      "en": "They took away their livestock: of their camels fifty thousand, and of sheep two hundred fifty thousand, and of donkeys two thousand, and of men one hundred thousand.",
      "ko": "저희가 대적의 짐승 곧 약대 오만과 양 이십 오만과 나귀 이천을 빼앗으며 사람 십만을 사로잡았고",
      "source_text_hash": "ba2a048b020eaf3f9c00f311f3462a10169c03b410c54c412d1ac0ac659c0a46",
      "translation_text_hash": "31fdc781b1a6d63bd0d5d597876d7bcf4cd969ff08a0be90366b292ea8c1c7e0",
