      "en": "These were the heads of their fathers’ houses: Epher, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah, and Jahdiel—mighty men of valor, famous men, heads of their fathers’ houses.",
      "ko": "그 족장은 에벨과 이시와 엘리엘과 아스리엘과 예레미야와 호다위야와 야디엘이라 다 용력이 유명한 족장이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "aabb5c82c3e2a86bb036d8594cd88bee1afd02ac7e2596052a4c6c38644c7c67",
      "translation_text_hash": "a8a796340f3f30d9ad27c7d67bbd5ca503f719a74d09f87038740e6ca444594a",
